1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Voice Mail. Visual voicemail for Android.
Tested on Mint Mobile.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Use your existing mailbox and your chosen dialer.
Swipe between All, Unread, and Saved.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Search contacts and saved transcript text.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Tap a phrase to play its source audio.
Search inside the transcript. Timing is approximate.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Audio stays in private app storage. Metadata is encrypted.
Whisper transcribes on the phone: Tiny, Base, or Large v3.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Select several messages for transcription or read status.
Carrier deletion retains a verified Saved copy.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Light, Dark, and true-black AMOLED.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Voice Mail 0.33. Android and Mint Mobile preview.
Synthetic demo messages. Feedback is welcome.
